{"unit_id":"chisato-lycoreco__dsh-serene#feature-weather","repo":"chisato-lycoreco/dsh-serene","commit":"bf4e70bb86b22a72b097400854b23a030ab0af20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-serene 的功能「天气记录」：agent 可把查到的天气和温度提交给 serene_weather，插件保存读数并在有效期内提供给上下文；插件本身不负责联网查询天气。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:161-197"]}
